    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74907" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὀρθάννης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
			ʽὀρθόσ̓</span> a sort of demon with the
		attributes of Priapus, <i><span class="en">
			Pl.Com.
			174.12
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			12(8).52
		</span></i> (Imbros, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
			Str.
			13.1.12
		</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
			Phot.
		</span></i> s. v.: written with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νν-</span> in
			<u>IG</u>l.c. and codd. of <i><span class="en">
			Pl.Com.
		</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
			Str.
		</span></i>, cf. Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
			1.70
		</span></i>, with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ν-</span> in <i><span class="en">
			Phot.
		</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὀρηθάνης</span> in <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὀρθαγένης</span>
		v.l. in
		<i><span class="en">
			Str.
		</span></i> l.c. ; <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὀρθάγης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					538
				</span></i>
			 (cf. Sch. ad loc.).</div>
